{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_015uAUX8NbQrnDMQmqQoGa5J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both gates are green. Summary:\n\n## Fix\n\n**`src/inference/adapter.ts`** — `boundContent` had one path that violated its own invariant: when `maxInputChars` was smaller than the truncation marker, `Math.max(0, maxInputChars - marker.length)` clamped `keep` to 0, so the function returned the marker alone — whose length exceeds `maxInputChars`. Replaced the silent clamp with an explicit guard: when the marker can't fit the budget, degrade to a plain head truncation (`content.slice(0, maxInputChars)`) that honors the cap exactly. For all normal inputs (marker fits), behavior is unchanged — `keep` is now guaranteed non-negative without the `Math.max`.\n\n## Test\n\n**`test/inference-prompts.test.ts`** — added a focused case under the existing DD-7 bounding block using `maxInputChars: 40` (a valid-but-small budget below the ~78-char marker — the counterexample). It asserts the bounded whole stays `≤ 40`, is a true prefix of the input (head-only degradation), and carries no marker text. This case fails against the pre-fix code (it returned the ~78-char marker), so it's a real regression guard.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Targeted Story 3 tests** (`vitest run test/inference-adapter.test.ts test/inference-prompts.test.ts`): 26/26 passed.\n- **Configured story gate** (`pnpm run verify` = `red-verify` build/typecheck/lint/boundaries + full `vitest run`): 37 files, 353/353 passed. (The `boundary advance failed …` line is a fault-injection test emitting its expected message, not a failure.)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1670,"cache_read_input_tokens":40312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1670},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7cef6c87-78e2-45ca-98c2-725c469882de","uuid":"a6adc413-5215-43a1-91bd-dc82a4643722","request_id":"req_011CbzBKbrMzPBXjpWoVJMwJ"}
